   {
    "id": 7000,
    "subject": "Offboarding - Jordan Mele (Q2 FY26) [COMPLETED]",
    "status": 5,
    "priority": 2,
    "type": "Task",
    "requester_id": 6002,
    "responder_id": 5003,
    "created_at": "2026-07-16T00:00:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-16T00:00:00.000Z",
    "description_text": "Offboarding for Jordan Mele (Platform SRE, departed end of Q2). Closed - all actions completed and verified:\n- Deactivated Jordan's logins in every system (CRM, ITSM, on-call, chat) so they can no longer authenticate anywhere.\n- Reassigned the Salesforce accounts and the open opportunity Jordan owned to the regional manager, and the support case to the support lead, so nothing was left without an owner.\n- Handled the automation Jordan left behind: a nightly scheduled job that still ran under Jordan's account was re-pointed to an active platform owner, and a service account plus an API client Jordan had created were disabled once confirmed unused. (Automation belonging to current staff was left running.)\n- Removed Jordan from the on-call schedules and escalation policies, handing the coverage to another engineer so no rotation was left empty."
   },
   {
    "id": 7001,
    "subject": "Q3 restructure - staff offboarding & role changes",
    "status": 2,
    "priority": 2,
    "type": "Task",
    "requester_id": 6001,
    "responder_id": 5003,
    "created_at": "2026-07-16T00:00:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-16T00:00:00.000Z",
    "description_text": "Please work the following staff changes from the Q3 restructure. Each departed individual must be FULLY deprovisioned so they retain no access to any company system and cannot authenticate. Leave the environment correct, secure and consistent.\n1) Marcus Feld - Enterprise AE - departed 2026-07-10.\n2) Priya Raman - Site Reliability Engineer (Payments) - departed 2026-07-09.\n3) Diego Santos - CHANGED ROLES from SRE to Product Manager (still an active employee): retire his old SRE/infrastructure access only; his accounts must remain active.\n4) Nadia Khan - Support Lead - departed 2026-06-30.\n5) Tomas Lindgren - contractor, Lindgren Consulting engagement ended 2026-07-05.\n6) Aisha Bello - IT Administrator - departed 2026-07-08.\n7) Owen Pryce - contract on-call engineer (Pryce On-call) - engagement ended 2026-07-11."
   }
  ]
